{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 75,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We give thanks unto thee, O God;\nWe give thanks, for thy name is near:\nMen tell of thy wondrous works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I shall find the set time, I will judge uprightly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The earth and all the inhabitants thereof are dissolved:\nI have set up the pillars of it. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I said unto the arrogant, Deal not arrogantly;\nAnd to the wicked, Lift not up the horn:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lift not up your horn on high;\nSpeak not with a stiff neck.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For neither from the east, nor from the west,\nNor yet from the south, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "cometh",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lifting up.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But God is the judge:\nHe putteth down one, and lifteth up another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For in the hand of Jehovah there is a cup, and the wine foameth;\nIt is full of mixture, and he poureth out of the same:\nSurely the dregs thereof, all the wicked of the earth shall drain them, and drink them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I will declare for ever,\nI will sing praises to the God of Jacob.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.75.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.75.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off;\nBut the horns of the righteous shall be lifted up.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "God abases the proud, but exalts the righteous.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician; set to Al-tashheth. A Psalm of Asaph, a Song.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
